   "section": "tome-orcs/data/talents/spells/galvanic-technomancy.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "You summon a galvanic rod at a location. Upon arrival the rod releases a shock in radius %d dealing %0.2f galvanic damage (fire and lightning) to all creatures.\n\t\tYou have 3 rods each with their own %d turns cooldown.\n\t\tThis spell works with Burning Wake.\n\t\tThis spell has 25%% chance to try to activate Hurricane, if used.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.",
   "target": "你在指定位置召唤放电柱。放电柱会在 %d 格半径范围内释放电击，对所有生物造成 %0.2f 放电（火焰和闪电）伤害。\n\t\t你有 3 枚放电柱，它们各自有 %d 回合的冷却时间。\n\t\t这一技能可以触发无尽之焰效果。\n\t\t若飓风已激活，这一法术有 25%% 的几率尝试触发它。\n\t\t技能伤害受法术强度加成。",
   "source_file": "/workspace/tome4-dlcs/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/spells/galvanic-technomancy.lua (unpinned public DLC checkout)",
   "source_lines": [
    106
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": true,
